# DEUS AI – Sprint 4

**Project:** DEUS AI

**Sprint:** Sprint 4

**Sprint Title:** Frontend Development and User Experience

**Duration:** September 2026

**Status:** Completed

---

# Sprint Goal

Develop the first production-ready web interface for DEUS AI and integrate it with the existing Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) backend.

The objective of this sprint was to transform the backend AI services into an intuitive conversational experience that allows users to interact naturally with BillyMacDeus' published writings through a modern web application.

---

# Sprint Objectives

- Build a responsive frontend interface.
- Connect the frontend to the FastAPI backend.
- Display AI-generated responses in real time.
- Improve usability and visual design.
- Prepare the application for future deployment.
- Maintain compatibility with BillyMacDeus.com.

